{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_6000_situation", "source_sha256": "aba573d4a7569045b7e5efefc95f873eda0e467400040bbd7c95326e946d8558", "ja": "グラビア撮影　準備中", "zh": "写真拍摄　准备中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_6000_place", "source_sha256": "d277b1a52942c7387477968f300b0855049e25673861b6b04d44ad187775db8c", "ja": "猫の集まる住宅街", "zh": "猫咪聚集的住宅区", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_6001_p", "source_sha256": "170dd0a64406ab12f88ce1e9d072dcedc0a1adb4101d15ced663e93a542476c8", "ja": "（アイドルグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の企画で、\n風花とたくさんの猫が暮らす街へやってきた……）", "zh": "（因为偶像写真杂志《爱格拉！！》的企划，和风花一起来到了一个有许多猫咪生活的街区……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_6002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c78c226be4b6e23f2a170224e72c3aea2ed3d62d9028cb297162375d5cd43628", "ja": "どんなネコちゃんがいるのかな～♪　一緒に遊んだり\n写真も撮りたいし……ああ、やることがいっぱい。", "zh": "不知道这里会有怎样的小猫咪呢～♪ 想和它们一起玩，也想拍照……啊，要做的事情太多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_6003_p", "source_sha256": "421dbf7795adf13bd86b8a78fc7187367c3b8dbce798f4debee8e13af086f884", "ja": "はは、いつになくご機嫌だな、風花。", "zh": "哈哈，今天的心情格外好啊，风花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_6004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "12274262ca002dc5c2c0b5df542237a113d17e594476a3864081f12971ab9e91", "ja": "はい♪　お仕事でネコちゃんと触れ合えるなんて\n嬉しくて……ずっと楽しみにしてたんです！", "zh": "是的♪　能在工作中和小猫亲近，我特别开心……一直都很期待呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_6005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "eade32b6c1880306551c502d358cb44a782fd0cdab738a40fdf6d09c4593378b", "ja": "それにこの場所も……ネコに出会える場所として\n有名で。いつか行ってみたいなって思ってたんですよ。", "zh": "而且这个地方……作为能遇见猫咪的地方很有名。我一直想着，什么时候一定要来看看呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_6006_p", "source_sha256": "70816bb1e850dd72a408e8ccf32f6ef1532dd13e215f45bb722c4441d5beb491", "ja": "そうだったのか。猫好きな風花にぴったりだと思ったん\nだが……まさかチェックしてた場所だったとは。", "zh": "原来是这样。我觉得这里很适合喜欢猫的风花……没想到竟然是你之前查过的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_6007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "bf0de2c3473a7b2b3914995c6469449d3bc95b91feb1b6674ee41f4ec2d0af49", "ja": "うふふ♪　今日の撮影、いっぱい頑張りますね。\nあっ……実は、ちょっとだけ心配なことがあって。", "zh": "呜呼呼♪今天的拍摄，我会努力表现的。\n啊……其实，有件事让我稍微有点担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_6008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0a6ae2103ba1cd00429ee4764405483e996d446912f6df6c1e574d5b853ee27b", "ja": "撮影中、ネコちゃんと触れ合うシーンが多いんです。\nどうすれば、スムーズに仲良くなれるでしょうか……？", "zh": "拍摄过程中，有很多要和小猫亲密接触的场景。\n要怎么做才能顺利和它们熟悉起来呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_6009_p", "source_sha256": "d049dcf8af8760b1dfe9cf858546494a0350d332a916088fb05a1dc40db094bd", "ja": "猫と仲良くか。それなら……。", "zh": "想和猫咪友好相处吗？那就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_6010", "source_sha256": "f64c62fe17f82b00bb12bf1a1bbbc613be79947ce3783ac20bbdfa0f075efabd", "ja": "母性を出して！", "zh": "展现你的母性！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_6011", "source_sha256": "8e737400842ee4e211260f1ef4bf8ee47fbe3aa4f32cf0e70ae520caa7da75a9", "ja": "風花にゃんだ！", "zh": "是风花喵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_6012", "source_sha256": "d40061d9334f2366a5c34cf07666c67007c383b2ffab82357413cede8f8ce8d7", "ja": "同じ目線で！", "zh": "用同样的视线！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_6100_p", "source_sha256": "8e4d77fc537b07fa2b9ac269968a8a6a5c463f4ecde9067fa59898e6578802a9", "ja": "猫たちのお母さんになりきってみるのはどうだ？\nもしかすると、甘えてきてくれるかもしれないぞ。", "zh": "要不要试着成为猫咪们的妈妈？  \n说不定它们会来向你撒娇呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_6101_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a88d20744bcd8f582b284e5d81081139fd1fd3cb52b74b45e753297e312866a2", "ja": "お母さんネコ……。それなら、ネコちゃんたちが\n安心できるような行動をした方がいいですよね？", "zh": "猫妈妈……那样的话，应该做些能让小猫们安心的事，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_6102_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e21e58262175bb975cfd2862dd8112a75eaa5fcab31fdcf0654c6d56e8576bab", "ja": "優しく体を撫でたり、ぎゅって抱きしめてあげたり……\nど、どうしよう。絶対ニヤニヤしちゃいます！", "zh": "温柔地抚摸它们，或者把它们紧紧抱在怀里……\n怎、怎么办？我肯定会忍不住傻笑的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_6200_p", "source_sha256": "b3110b5efdc8b5c3f114fd9c7b454edd0b0a15eeeb30be43eef7de83e0100655", "ja": "いっそ猫になりきって、思いっきり楽しもう！\nそうすれば新しい仲間だと思ってくれるんじゃないか？", "zh": "干脆彻底装成猫，尽情享受吧！\n这样一来，它们说不定就会把我们当成新伙伴了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_6201_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f2cce5206097854817f4bfda3ba496b7e3422fb7f06c3ec913c890363f6975d9", "ja": "確かに……！　今の衣装なら仲間だと思ってくれるかも\nしれませんね。よーし、それなら喋り方も変えて……。", "zh": "说得也是……！穿着现在这套服装，它们说不定真的会把我当成同伴呢。好，那说话方式也改一改……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_6202_041fuk", "source_sha256": "61dc06cbab3c1f2d1008e3f9c1c26e1f7b1b8cbbc55328192a567c9535fdf655", "ja": "「にゃにゃにゃーにゃーにゃん、にゃにゃにゃ？」\n……私がなんて言ったか、わかりますか？　ふふっ♪", "zh": "“喵喵喵——喵——喵，喵喵喵？”\n……您知道我说了什么吗？呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_6300_p", "source_sha256": "b843ff371ec534b114a4e5711f1a0efda340f495dca881f90134a0dbc499070a", "ja": "猫と同じ目線になることが大事じゃないかな？\n仲良くなりたいって気持ちが伝わると思うぞ！", "zh": "我觉得，和猫保持同样的视线高度很重要吧？\n这样应该能让它感受到你想和它亲近的心情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_6301_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c097510ec696ebaf412163f12500f9ec9c0cdd34f544dc9d660bfe1185491e94", "ja": "なるほど……。自分より体の大きい存在って、怖いです\nもんね。私、ネコちゃんの目線に合わせてみます！", "zh": "原来如此……比自己体型大的存在，确实会让人害怕呢。我试着和猫咪保持同样的视线！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_6302_041fuk", "source_sha256": "bb6232769dc31dee0babb86a9a5c36ae392b783a206c027f4b61517bde24da5d", "ja": "姿勢を低くしてネコちゃんっぽいポーズに……あれ？\nそれだと、セクシー路線になっちゃいませんか！？", "zh": "放低姿势，摆出像猫咪一样的姿势……咦？\n那样的话，不就变成走性感路线了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
